{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1379,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88ecbe43497d24953f212f87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如预想那般地奔跑了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f045b7f00c6991110ead2a4e428725e02c1716cca22993746234f40d3eb9a98e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f0381bd430d2fc21670d481",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れ様",
      "source_fingerprint": "b953841c6237f6f93550f5268f577fd573201293558ed014b9eb53c636e0c0c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bebab86a9a6d43d1d2080e64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和我一决胜负？\r\n……嗯，我明白了。\r\n我会全力以赴的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1962109929863bb1274839e20b5b0aa85b593fcf5b74245c7a9df07cd9b7b6cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4069615e082153c81c85013d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害……不过，\r\n我也还能变得更强的！\r\n可别擅自对我失望啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86055865cadcab573d011d868a7795af45ea69300e53d821fb8790e5c8fd22e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18f9c0e7acf36670efa3a4c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早啊……诶，怎么了？\r\n不就跟你打了个招呼吗，\r\n别这么死盯着我看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dc9f60328d72b6557b6e96dc4c78553c143fe7200e0b8b4a914c237dbc8a478",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec4cfda1a64e77e266a5ffeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从早上开始就保持优雅……真难啊。\r\n困得止不住地发呆……\r\n麦昆可真厉害啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4525a67e3fc8cfad5cee3bb9fa67cae1bb0e430afdd46b440074c593fc411ce2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a27b91453737c8ff8de78e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休息日去吃午饭的时候，\r\n看见大家都穿着非常可爱的衣服……\r\n我可没法穿那种衣服啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f057f7992bf2cb8459a7bcdc93985322f1c6b8fa765223e26f992e96627c9545",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:343bc5fcd245bf2b322afe9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要用午休时间来训练一会儿吗……？\r\n……我才没有在勉强自己了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9ee5fe4b5bef5e32efcff110f5de60f66f00eb7eeface3d19fb46d64aeea55d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf625b2ec11de6fc54c209e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都到这时间了还在工作吗？\r\n明天还有别的工作，\r\n可别太过逞强结果累倒了哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "96d7d96ae07fc2ec69d1bf3efe95f35521b81e9f98e93259393c4a13dec635a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a31d54fc6bc929dea32d9a35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼哇……嗯嗯……打了个哈欠啊……诶？！\r\n……你看见了吗？\r\n忘记！给我删掉那份记忆！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66efdd78e55fdc573d09749fc2fad3198f0ae1518cedce9a1ac3953e636797bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08e5069f6a315dc4eb80d280",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好多新生啊……\r\n每个人看上去都闪闪发光的，\r\n我根本没法直视她们……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2573943395186457364733ba5058e21e27ad335ebcc518c93610d6e0c8f1f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4f310d82f421fc13dc3511b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得好好注意防暑措施……！\r\n要是在大家面前倒下的话一定会引人注目，\r\n那我的学生生涯就结束了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c801372756b7bd6841f4ba1b957235d2a5dce1121f2f11425165e3552ca7f85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6a2a438ef406ace9dbcf904",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚还在想着落叶的味道也不赖，\r\n结果就从外边闻到了烤地瓜的香味……\r\n……等等，是校内的味道……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dccf546734c372161ac30355cb53eed3af22b5c140cebe92c6ca01145f96de59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1263953c0d2786d019e096b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别、别靠近我！！\r\n这个季节正是静电盛——噫？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "352f1a2295f128982a3126cbd8cca13af868733b4cf1593cf9c8366327964ce8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:482613b32544c2b25dc3113d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我倒也没那么擅长起床……\r\n只是因为要做的事情太多了，\r\n所以才会在该起床的时候醒来而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "760b5c95ec51800cc8ecedf6e2b05eb5b7cf368bf9362bd211f0b56a77b9352c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67f4dede763887580effdff1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还是很困吗？\r\n换上凉快点的衣服怎么样？\r\n这样应该能稍微清醒一些吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14a0ed47e7ad967d4c6211549ae8bcbac5a1180611fe292b62f5dfb8307b7ef5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39fb724c842836fe765d71a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个……我有个想去的餐厅来着……\r\n听说他们的菜品营养都很丰富……\r\n那……你去不去？",
      "source_fingerprint": "38a87ed69a6b8d39a45ee592b8fa12d4c4d87fde129a792b1b7b15bcf16bdaa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d1d42f03102a3f21cc9517f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的吃法很优雅……？\r\n这大概是……小时候就养成的习惯吧……\r\n因为我不能家族聚餐时丢人现眼啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5905f88b07d8a8bb75b3a857560e460dc2c01525ef87f86a24a071e36bbfcec7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06144c9c78b06eb7a77e8eb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……要我帮你整理资料吗？\r\n……我只是不喜欢对能做到的事情袖手旁观而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd86d03e125b5570df1fc16ce8f97ef778b770e2370fab31ccaf32b26bda192a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0436f57d0f6c21e84e703f33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔休息一下也很重要的哦。\r\n去散散步如何？\r\n夜晚的空气总是能让人心情平静呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a90e22a745b2b242337b91a94a2886e36fab845bf64553141186ce1e20fd1abf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6310b9bfa9615e0081c0815f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实还是多注意下春风比较好哦。\r\n帽子一不小心就会被吹飞，找起来很麻烦的……\r\n……只是姑且先给你提个醒而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32a248818cc1e7342084b5126f84f67ebb010e5fbd776f28be70a0c21ab9acc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:507a8aa4699e601d687ff83b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有点期待暑假呢……\r\n海风携着帽子飘远、在沙滩上拾起漂流瓶……\r\n……这是不是有点美好过头了啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c9fcb800b68f5d643e10a36d15211333b130e483eb9673822dac9aa4ba6b519",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97b67a124ec0fa777b78fe38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要去京都看看比赛吗？\r\n观战时也能学到新东西，红叶也差不多……\r\n总、总之你考虑一下吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d9c6bbd1e80945a8f022db23eeea39967236ba9c5731e56377a2b8a6a10b75b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bf58ce21087a5f828cf4c2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你觉得冷的话，喝点热饮怎么样？\r\n要是姜汁茶就好的话……\r\n我分你一点吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "967d32003a778c4d9ccc885f1eeeb05bc141c6eafe009d53627b0f1d6bf54226",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d10b900f825d90774712c8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节……快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b7e11dcf7d36399b15d230c810a93a48bd78c089bc62a3db49804ea1160b8b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abdfc56e2805ece4dc02cf29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节……快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73e5257333c2e04839d48f8f8b71fd57c1377c9c6546eb55075e25a30db5cdb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69c5e390ebc9f0604d6ad6af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好……怎、怎么了？\r\n为什么这样看我……啊……\r\n难、难道说你也睡着了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b2daf09f26252da8b798aea0d3e0fd8c352cdafcf67bca05cc1d8c02f17ead0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6547b513470efb825320ead",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以用午休时间来训练一会儿吗？\r\n……没事，我不会勉强自己的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f34d8f0dfa465e875c4fbca8974d51ff3a13e1c10569af3c09b61467f74147e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af5176b5349fc50cf2078592",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都已经是这个时间了……\r\n训练员还在工作吗？\r\n那个……别太勉强自己了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1486e0f64ae8c2671a50e73d722b9faf092cd0bc2e3c20cd42dfd11613e51984",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72e35ea52003469b8f5afae4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼哇……嗯嗯……打了个哈欠啊……诶？！\r\n你看见了吗？！\r\n讨厌……好羞耻啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "18033a283eeb736bc45357a78462455eff43907894869ceb08d360bc54d3bfa6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35aac8dd94ffd773587e409b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别、别靠近我！\r\n不是，不是讨厌你，\r\n只是这个季节的静电……噫！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57dbe216de2a0e9e5f16826677d0bc6fd6150380e103236570cc0c4f4eed188f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f5859c2b46eb03dc49cd4ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的发型怎么样？\r\n最近我也越来越擅长编头发了……\r\n呵呵，果然早起也是有好处的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06e581c7114198a7cd754d045560669a85088491648e951c267547142c9080b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a2b17140ec16115e281e4de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你莫非……还在犯困吗？\r\n那换一身清凉点的衣服就好啦。\r\n这样的话，只要沐浴在晨风中就会清醒起来呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d96f4818174ad2fadc4b254f120f0953465a60ce7adaed385bb0dc64ae094ffe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:888405cb3264beb5a6e1836f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我说……要一起去咖啡厅吗？\r\n我想穿着这身衣服和你一起出去玩、一起喝茶……\r\n你觉得怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "88c0ef57ead3910dfdb109d6495452400e5f6b720548e46796d32428921a4f1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e78bb7f66dcc0099873c41d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你还在工作吗？\r\n要不要一起去散个步……？\r\n劳逸结合的话，工作效率也会提升的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3bb077d271cceecec0b75cbe1708a173bb1482b6297a327a6e56f9eacead1d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7d45ba9a978aa7d2df81784",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定得小心春风才行呢。\r\n只要一不小心就会把我的帽子吹飞，\r\n找起来真的很麻烦呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a34fe51c0e1ecac4f3152ee760393cac216504d47e4e0fdcfc37a44845bf620e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0f39e69a8c89748664d5655",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近天气也转凉了……\r\n要不要出个远门去京都看比赛、赏红叶……\r\n什么的，怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cfcdda4de872bcfd963bb36e73e4cd8cba136c5d658f97437bb5cae4d525c8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b82774f6aa28570e477f68ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是你觉得冷的话随时说哦。\r\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "0910f9f1d3df8d62366ce87eef975af35732cd5b7648c0fcbf340f72a2005db9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "90119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aec58a86309e7f53b3c72d40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明明给爸爸说过别叫我『小铃铛』了\r\n但他还是……啊，呃……没事！\r\n（小铃铛：多伯ドーベル，铃铛ベル）",
      "source_fingerprint": "4912c59d7cd883afb9c56fb47cfab4d876bbae8298e45bde168e63e318466edc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2086b59a538c096a935a3119",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别老是打听我小时候的回忆啦，\r\n也不全是美好的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f55b5cec0b97287d5dc12bad7a3112a3977e260451099cc73e0a67df1aaf1f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f77f8a9f5283ed403993badc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前给赖恩添了不少麻烦……\r\n但现在，我可以昂首挺胸地告诉她不用担心我了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f51e97f324a3449c785e2efd6d883fa2b0b6dea7291a666a762fbdc594f4ff0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4479334d17f9be9c5b090951",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……你有弟弟或者妹妹吗？\r\n跟小孩子打交道这种事情……\r\n……没、没事。只是问问看而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37482f7a6e3c34bbaeae1474ef09e51ba51e22031c0838acffeca61023dbc831",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c214ac177bfbf6a137c41e71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目白家的大家都是凛然又优雅，\r\n都非常出色呢。\r\n……我和她们就不一样了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1216f77b8f0e5dc68a6ec770204c958c496b6861dee3177391c5193f48fa014c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bc347da946bfc8bf26609eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都说这套衣服和我很搭……\r\n但是……一定都是客套话吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4248e4b86083fd042dbeb833b86f260be6cfd0446c8de30def53f158d77a212",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efa383502d17e6e87d0060e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哒、哒、哒～……♪\r\n呵呵，轻飘飘的……啊？！\r\n没、没有！这是在练习而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6c47f583820ec1f87b1d14c317e140bfc80f5c1b81a458c9990a23992a95a6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60fd61beb121a754318be7b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这可是满怀着我的心意的衣服，\r\n穿上它的话可得拿出不令其蒙羞的实力才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "acd7bb1871196feca272aec8ea3a0667fb48d7f85d8bc87741d782d15127b18b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3aab8ea9174f59b67e8d761a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……是不是有点可爱过头了啊。\r\n……没、没有！这是我自己定好的衣服，\r\n一定要堂堂正正地……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a96817e5fd78c0f0cc0b4df36393a0e90909f82b4c16a1d054eb25580c473cd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecacdba9e4924b7399e4f652",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然时常想早起晨练，\r\n但大树起床发现我不在的话，\r\n她一定会觉得寂寞的吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "156d47bc89d1041fac65e67d394d8511446c34c0160c829ae6f2bed5603b1145",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18110e599fcb8c7ac30ab82a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "漫画里常看见角色们亲手做便当呢……\r\n我也要试着做做看吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "72ee6a11a7ae154298ee11e4d688e0b5024961d15d1c015ebd0fd68201c3253d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3366c599b187c3129d8ab359",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在晚上训练更容易让人冷静呢……\r\n感觉不到其他人的视线，\r\n也更容易集中精力……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "340caf52bb82dfc19d7d4200ffd9e83db79dae1ea552ccb5967103b6fe87ea56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d10ba187b4831c66d1cd40c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我还挺喜欢赏花的，\r\n毕竟大家都只会关注着美丽的花而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fddeb7249d13cb687d3fe7eb9d5d34ec44913e4d9df0e8d7abd1e8b244d7bfc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59fe66ceae3d04de7509735b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨天夜里，\r\n好像听见了类似于雷鸣的声音呢……\r\n哈啊……虽然我还蛮喜欢下雨的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed3dd29565facec94373479ab2b86c3e736e71c369eaf9b1d0fbd6ef0612b5ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23e1b763da2073523eaee60d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说起来，今天目白家的大家要举办茶会呢。\r\n……呵呵，红叶之下的茶会，好期待呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed21fd5466095d0b372770a758796fe2c4798464ecc789194b1a8caf1be2efbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04efd087121dc9bc79b15770",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "控制甜食的摄入，然后……\r\n啊啊真是的……\r\n为什么冬天就容易不小心长胖啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9101d521b719866d8d4e7d670893d835f30e884a89043ccb4b2d798bfce59850",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddc6d66e5cbf591cc4066b44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『就像模特那样超酷的！』\r\n善信她真是太温柔了，\r\n有时候实在是夸我夸过头啦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8aae0654d642941b85db1684bf72c549c666b6c3cb5b2f5b699de635a2c9cbf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a20c7ad3c06a177f5911cfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我也挺喜欢穿这身出门的，\r\n但总会在不知不觉间绕远路，这可是个难题啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dadfe3837b7fa07dce74e9083176f23cafbd9efd6b80193538fe14ddc32c5c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfddc6f25f19a6e74ee726fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你刚刚没看见我的背吧？！\r\n哈啊……没想到晒痕这么久都消不掉啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b79491c6c47a6f7685b5357b22c31e268190fc35c1e8045cb5b8321d882b8bd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3aa675601d8632ddfd681a09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……感觉不错。出门前\r\n根据目的地不同多配些芳香剂吧……\r\n说不定也正好能当作转换心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28bc24c4a9afbe36ae84ae2c072ff190a39213f5bc0f05aa119912766dbc5829",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c77aa3a7b5be8c2ce59d344",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本来在学园里饲养猛禽应该是件非常危险的事……\r\n但既然他们关系这么好的话……\r\n总之，还是多加注意比较好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f0a6a653fa19891a4a8a0fc72fa7f115b5c6600cc72fa86420f783f889aee3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d94a31e2ab869448fb4f4e4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，今早碰见的那只狗狗的毛……\r\n最近散步的时候经常碰见它呢，\r\n呵呵……它真是又调皮又可爱呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7db72583b8ff1ab23d8fccdbe762386a2117e3577dc329ea9b26bad264b5608",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6da9c93456d06c6c354f22aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原来BBQ是每周末都能搞的\r\n活动吗？！她们每周都来邀请我……\r\n啊！难道说这是大树开的玩笑吗？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48321a6e86a7d5c99956d76ebe226a3f78bf1f2d61602c1cd90e0673cb51ef04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a7841b1157b6808a877dcef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听荒漠说，睡前读书有助入眠呢……\r\n要是有效果的话，就去向荒漠道谢吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "219489b37a85362032bb55036c4f8119c873870b9e76bbeb0fed2ea8b3379c18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd6854ad8238afdbe735e983",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵……怎么样？这样笑的话，\r\n新生也会觉得我更容易搭话吧？\r\n还是说，嘴角再上扬一点比较好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9fc2bee354bc59c110163eac5dbefdc8541bfe6a339afdf7db573c74f21be43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc50735f5a5746fff4a49185",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是太阳太毒的话，戴一顶帽子怎么样？\r\n为了预防中暑，我选了宽帽檐款的……\r\n你、你别选和我同款的啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "739b7f4438da3a84b7123652f2154140de9fb47f1c12b6f4911203b174e51b33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beae9ac8ea4db4293077cd60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说英国那边的红叶好像反而是黄色的偏多呢？\r\n只是很闲才调查一下而已，\r\n才不是想去玩……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4fdceb39feae16cd8c3a89a9eea4714edbedf556a5a4c916f7351316663fb9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:080625be6627753132a68e1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用缎带挡起来吧……不、不行！\r\n要好好通过锻炼来减肥才行！\r\n就在这个冬天把赘肉全都减掉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "353d1785e4b7b2faf3e9c3fd5703d9656e411b2682a1612530a9a0b77f80e746",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23c2dd4e9ca2a8a8738768c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得谢谢赖恩送给我这件衣服啊。\r\n下次就由我给她选衣服吧……\r\n嗯，就给她选些可爱系的衣服吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a339fcfb8aa502348bbfce6d9f0dfd78e9c17526178f24c42c49d6568c719f73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d72b4f824ed1d952bb18d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光明每天都在编这种头发吗……\r\n这种蓬松的感觉真是模仿不来啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1b641d4429b345f3c06c31ce0e40f3714ab66fa430b541a0bd67b71123e6b3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82dfc9c4ce1ca3abaf936dfd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然也有不少开心的事儿……\r\n但说实话，我还是不大愿意回忆自己的童年时光啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1591d08cb4ac139b03a5f7047b7c4deea0fd0e36fd607b0fa8cd42f13807ef5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b765c780703a01718ef74ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，你有年纪差得比较大的弟弟妹妹吗？\r\n……就是……想问问，该怎么哄他们开心呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8589108f1e7835ae22c24d37e51fd1bec70cd81578109e0f90aba24b305eae02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc4859aae61543ee7fd9b966",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目白家的大家都是凛然又优雅，\r\n都非常出色呢。\r\n我和她们比起来……完全不行啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cf45f5d8c5682848449fbb9d127bd232d1ab3e1a1d99c964d30dacb35f9685e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcfa86da78d36e41d509c282",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多读书有很多好处的哦。\r\n比如说在睡前读读书的话，也能睡得更香……\r\n……只是对荒漠说的话现学现卖而已啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66619a66c76dbcef806c47c41be93c1538caab0863cafa3c2080ee7c187730ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:748ddc1e2fd466ad8dddeabc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要在夏天出门的话，戴一顶宽檐帽就好了哦。\r\n既凉快、还能防日晒……\r\n……要和我选同款的帽子吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d330f0c5ac456c25f69bf6e17b1e4d1123d00a42ad3d6a758453ce66327864e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91125"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6182b3fc21a2c2458fc1ee9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "英国的红叶好像大多都偏黄呢。\r\n那些树叶之下的宫殿一定会很漂亮的……\r\n以后一起去玩吧，怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "084b52a9c15d60759eee02f3a565afc046ddc09f620fb9f44acd831549b47f6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "91126"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4d2104fcfe9f89b02f8027d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经准备好了，快开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c13665209586c38551444c0c112ce946447b0ed66e0543ee8ff57b9d440d3db2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84525d29a2d45e331c2bab14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくよ",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec2a56a58429231694dd81c4df5552216c153cce140373d077cf55c0868b623a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8823128ec93d65263a4314a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别去注意其他事……别去注意……\r\n集中在训练上……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a09cae4688c1a7997381f5d08881441b286ce16c08aa8937bf39a8db715a40e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a1f67e98d76c1f5e741c65c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想要变得更强。\r\n……而你就是让我变强的训练员。\r\n好好干吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1895da0088dff1eaff1041ca1247096f60b7a4100f9cae95f1a0f06c1c806d5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c13d62adb3e3882bbf17d2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我其实不怎么紧张。\r\n只要按照我自己方式奔跑就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da8f2f04d59474f169345c9088f1ca449f9585f8a1deb6f5815499d59aaa498f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0159ca498acdb7e1a783687d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你在考虑训练菜单吗？\r\n那赶紧给我指示吧。\r\n我会照办的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bdbadb6966a3c4c9206cdc2beba3d4d34f5e264d9cdef3a57e66c2efa9d81cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
